WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.108
A real reply pauses for two approval questions.

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:12.456
Answer the complete batch before resuming.

00:00:12.456 --> 00:00:18.144
Resume sends both answers and continues the same turn.

00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:19.898
Resume complete.

00:00:19.898 --> 00:00:25.356
A new turn gets a new approval batch.

00:00:25.356 --> 00:00:30.606
Read-only replay.

00:00:30.606 --> 00:00:35.766
Back live. Paused.
